6410:     // parsed from the SAME single comment fetch — per-head re-dispatch counts
6411:     // (crash-loop cap) and the newest marker's timestamp (1/head/hour bound).
6412:     // A read failure above leaves {} — the zombie branch then treats the head
6413:     // as never-re-dispatched (one bounded extra dispatch worst case).
