7029: // The marker line the NEXT fail report appends for this head: takes the
7030: // ALREADY-READ prior count on the same SHA (N = prior + 1 — the caller
7031: // holds failMarkerState; no second fetch), cap noted for the reader.
7032: // null when the head SHA is unknown — nothing to record.
7033: function redHeadMarkerLine(priorReds, headSha, cap) {
7034:     if (!headSha) return null;
7035:     return '\uD83D\uDD34 red head ' + headSha + ' \u2014 red ' + (priorReds + 1) + '/' + cap +
